// Home EV Solar Control (HESC) v1.4.0 — Home battery <-> EV (kickstart)
// Problem: while the home batteries charge, the charger in solar mode sees no surplus and never starts.
// (1) Kickstart: when the sun left today is clearly more than the home batteries still need (+20% margin, plus a minimum
//     for the EV), and the home batteries have been charging for a while: Start -> pause as soon as HBC sees the EV ->
//     ~40 s -> back to solar mode. HBC then keeps the home batteries still for a few minutes, the charger in solar mode
